{"seq":8,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:08:34.747Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"24b461af0b1dbbcc0472fe7b98f2d9cd1304b215e238ed3991c4b4593f6f8f3e","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, I couldn't find a single digest that lists all four owners, so this is pieced together from Moss's digests. Two of the four are firm.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It used to be Nadia Fennimore's account. The 5/4/2026 digest records Nadia's industrial account being reassigned in the CRM effective **2026-05-04**. It doesn't name Vantorre Group in that line, but the context points to it.\n  - By 7/1 the pod's chat refers to it as \"Nadia's old industrial account\".\n  - The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n  - I'd confirm 5/4 in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The digests have called it his fleet account since 7/2025. The 5/4/2026 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, which is unclear.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, probably. It was Nadia's medical account in 3/2025. The 9/30/2026 digest lists \"Gideon's medical account\", but it never names Orlavine. Please confirm.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** Nadia Fennimore, probably. This is the weakest of the four. The digests only call it the pod's outdoor or retail account. Nadia is the one running the 10/2 gate-clerk training for it, and the 3/2025 digest ties a Nadia-run account to it.\n\nI only checked the digests and pod channels. I couldn't see any account files or CRM records, so those are the place to confirm Orlavine and Quillfeather."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
